de&#287;i&#351;tirilmi&#351;tir. </p>

<p class=GENELKURUL style='margin-left:0cm;text-indent:42.55pt'>c) 155 inci
maddesinin ba&#351;l&#305;&#287;&#305; “Cumhurba&#351;kan&#305;,
